# <<< coding-friend managed
# Track project custom skills (e.g. cf-ship-custom) in git; config.json stays ignored.
# coding-friend may rewrite its managed block on update: re-check with `git check-ignore` after a cf update.
!.coding-friend/skills/

skills-lock.json
